WEBVTT

00:17:29.121 --> 00:17:33.829
Johnny got his gun. Dalton Trumbo, really,
really powerfully important book.

00:17:33.871 --> 00:17:36.121
I think I was about 14 when I read it.

00:17:36.746 --> 00:17:42.329
And it's just, you know, you're inside the
mind of a man who's had, you know,

00:17:43.246 --> 00:17:46.288
been deeply injured in the
war and lost his limbs.

00:17:46.288 --> 00:17:50.746
And he's, you know, you're just living in
his head and and having his memories

00:17:50.746 --> 00:17:54.913
and his delusions and his his
sorrows and his rages.

00:17:54.913 --> 00:17:56.913
And you're right there inside of him.

00:17:57.246 --> 00:18:00.954
And I think it was this maybe the
first book that the material was